# Admin panel location

When the user says **admin panel**, **admin**, or **admin dashboard**, they mean the separate app at:

`E:\projects\FinderB Sites\FinderB Admin`

Not anything under this FinderB website repo.

## Rules

- Implement admin UI, tabs, and content CRUD in **FinderB Admin** (`src/app/dashboard/page.tsx`, `src/components/`, etc.).
- Do **not** add or restore `/admin` routes in this FinderB site for ops/content management.
- This site may still read admin-curated data (e.g. YouTube playlists from Supabase) for the public homepage.
- Shared Supabase tables/SQL for features can live in this repo (`supabase/`), but the control UI belongs in FinderB Admin.
